{%- comment -%}
  PROMUNCH FAQPage structured data, corrected 10 Oct 2026.
  Paste this whole file into layout/theme.liquid IN PLACE OF the old FAQPage
  block (the one that starts with the line  if page.handle == 'faqs'  and
  ends with the matching endif line). See THEME_INSTALL.md step 4.

  Why it changed: the old block said all PROMUNCH snacks are "100% roasted
  (never fried)" and "completely gluten-free". Per the Master KB the roasted lines
  are Soya Crunchies and Roasted Edamame (roasted in olive oil); Soya Sticks
  and Soya Chips are FRIED. Gluten-free is not confirmed for the whole range, so it is left out.

  Every answer here must also appear (in the same meaning) on the visible
  FAQ page at promunch.in/pages/faqs. If the visible page still says
  "never fried" or "gluten-free", fix the page text too.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if page.handle == 'faqs' or template contains 'faq' %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
