        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "PROMUNCH makes high-protein savoury snacks from soya and edamame. The range has Roasted Edamame (roasted in olive oil), Soya Crunchies (roasted), and Soya Sticks and Soya Chips (fried). Check each pack label for the full ingredient list."
